    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一次日常</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Shownotes</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 学会甩锅了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 常规认知里学习和工作的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 说说妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 我的认知一般是怎么建立的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 我能掌握的微小尺度，和常规读书的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 想要有的办公室和其他房间</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>底乐</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>坂本龍一&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Koko》《Mizu No Naka No Bagatelle - Suntory Old Cm》《Seven Samurai》</span></p><span></span><p><span>张悬-9522《最好的时光》</span></p>]]></description>
