  <item>
    <title>vol.33 八月里转瞬即逝的高光</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63b462dcda83c49d996a5c25</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63b462dcda83c49d996a5c25</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jan 2023 17:16:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>回听仍觉察到讲话吃力且断句不当，可2022年八月的惊喜和灵动犹在眼前，也不妨上传。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/34953968/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/34953968/"><span>豆瓣读书条目《无知的教师》</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Shownotes</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 什么缘由下做了这期播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 迫不及待地要读出来，第三章「平等者的理性」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 读这本书的一种感受，让我看到希望、打开更多可能性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 由此联想，最初我做播客的原因是什么......我们不如来看《无知的教师》，看《野性的思维》，或者《悉达多》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 第五章 「解放者的猴戏」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> 如果这是一期有用的播客，书末「解放者的墓志铭」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> "我们只能继续指出这条不同寻常的道路，它要求人在每个句子、每个行动中，发现平等的一面，平等不是我们追求的目的，而是我们的起点，使我们在任何情况下要坚持的假设......"</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>八月碎片</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZQWMT7gaSWZmptRKwV1wu7sSpS.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>八月的某个便签标题</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtUTe_sYR8f8U0QbiMilJq8Gp6K5.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>半月快题中，酒店里听播客</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNXYa8Et5n8lzUAZKY2tYO2fuzu.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>勇敢女孩（自勉）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhv5pcDYrFE4oLHnKn01lXVX4CQX.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>高铁上的晚霞-1</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhqhnJvUg49mBERV7nwJRn7l7kZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>高铁上的晚霞-2</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>回归啦，收听愉快 :D</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh7L7pP-Wy9_oYSSr7gN5gYX-ZJI.m4a" length="56714509" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrRXZnNWRVTldhRnE2RE9lLXQyRHN1ai1QZTcucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
