  <item>
    <title>vol.27 我清内存、你拆盲盒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626984b0bf39836fd02b77ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626984b0bf39836fd02b77ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Apr 2022 18:00:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每次和他人聊亲密关系我总能扯到自己，然后感慨、持续自我探索，无解-想死</span></p><span></span><p><span>加上最近尤其想更一期（毕竟立了flag）</span></p><span></span><p><span>那就，</span><strong><span>我清内存、你拆盲盒</span></strong><span>好了</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然听众不一定按照正序的时间线听播客，我也可以选择乱侃时间线</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，这种情况下，更应该被看到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有说法是睡好觉能解决大多数问题，可对我来说好难做到。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【啊、我甩几个片段进au啦】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【啊、要求不要很多、内容/声音能听就好了嘿是吧】</span></p><span></span><p><span>【先不要求自己剪辑了唔】</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a>上海疫情，难受、自己却也很忙（的无力）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a>又是午饭，在餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a>忘记带手机了啊喂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a>承认一个很克中我的点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a>是啦，黄昏又在湖边走</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：《変身ゲーム》（如果你是假的）王菲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FjybT1IQ97STOfkCp-r8kTswaxl_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（建筑生积极抗疫嗯）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fi_FVXq2-hpB4EgZVl0RnmwG19WT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FuxsKSYGz7NxUT41X2O1Q-5zgGGT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FppmtssyGjd5wYM7LyqW3n5cdEqE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（a摘了三个喜欢的拼贴诗）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/loNcYul1_MD0XlPktAhoSimDvUFf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>好了，做完了一期，不想死了。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmDzNtoD6qM-SvclaM6yye_kjdF4.m4a" length="36531878" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L2xqWW9tZjB2SlFqYlQxQ2RURG83V093R1gyZl8ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
