  <item>
    <title>vol.26 忙碌里的高光时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62309bfdd9985ffdf1ac0308</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62309bfdd9985ffdf1ac0308</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Mar 2022 14:00:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>诉说是缓解焦虑的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>照旧复习，中间夹杂课设，触点再放得更大的同时、偶尔也会有皱缩</span></p><span></span><p><span>这时就——</span><strong><span>深呼吸，拥抱自己，再继续走下去做下去</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>朋友们不要戴耳机听，有爆破音、伤耳朵。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我承认环境音太大了，我不太有时间好好剪辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的书籍</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26580132/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26580132/"><span>《学习的本质》安德烈·塔可夫斯基 Andrei Tarkovsky</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>底乐:</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾轶可《Buring》</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈婧霏《深蓝》</span></p><span></span><p><span>福禄寿《春暖花开去见你》</span></p>]]></description>
