    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>先来听首歌吧！在操场上遇到伙伴了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>近来的状态是，听很多播客，看很多书，画一些抄绘。</span></p><span></span><p><span>跑步后，允许我一本正经地说些无聊话。很喜欢晚上八点半的操场，尤其在雨后的晚上。</span></p><span></span><p><span>放出来，也希望不要囿于自己的小圈子里。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>片尾：Gatsby in a Daze《蒼南夜語》</span></h2><span></span><p><span>播客推荐：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62270b2bfb33eaa618f9f402?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmZWVmYTg5ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFhNDM3NyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62270b2bfb33eaa618f9f402?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmZWVmYTg5ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFhNDM3NyJ9"><span>啊！是猫咪啊！|S2.E01【遥远的相似性】我的孤独何以认出你的孤独？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>遥远的相似性，是近来不断重复出现在自己脑海里的词。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5e282deb418a84a0462284d1?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmZWVmYTg5ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFhNDM3NyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5e282deb418a84a0462284d1?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmZWVmYTg5ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmFhNDM3NyJ9"><span>迟早更新|Episode117：轻微程度的重复说明</span></a></p><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
